{"title":"Mossback Ancient","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 50 Mossback that attacks with crush (melee). It will not attack first.</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">shock</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">slash</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">burn</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 1 times (2.4% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/mossback-ancient\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/mossback-ancient?lv=49\">Lv 49 <span>165</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/mossback-ancient?lv=50\">Lv 50 <span>175</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/mossback-ancient?lv=49\" title=\"Pick level 49\"><td><b>49</b></td><td>290</td><td>31.5</td><td>2,450</td><td class=\"muted\">870 · 44.1 · 7,350</td><td>165</td><td>in the wilds around 2260, 1478</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/mossback-ancient?lv=50\" title=\"Pick level 50\"><td><b>50</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>303</td><td>32</td><td>2,500</td><td class=\"muted\">909 · 44.8 · 7,500</td><td>175</td><td>in the wilds around 2254, 1476</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 5 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"shell-stone\" title=\"Shell Stone - in 3 of 5 looted corpses, 3 recorded drops, 6 total, 2 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/c64481875084d7ec0d03.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Shell Stone</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.7<br>×2</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"ancient-moss\" title=\"Ancient Moss - in 3 of 5 looted corpses, 3 recorded drops, 5 total, 1–2 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/d586c8d80dfb5cdeac77.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ancient Moss</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.7<br>×1–2</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"living-moss\" title=\"Living Moss - in 1 of 5 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/0a59352953e2cefa4996.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Living Moss</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/5<br>×1</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses whose loot was recorded; kills nobody looted are not counted), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(-1065.7px,-2569.4px)\"><img src=\"wtiles/2/3/9.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:768px;top:2304px\"><img src=\"wtiles/2/3/10.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:768px;top:2560px\"><img src=\"wtiles/2/4/9.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:1024px;top:2304px\"><img src=\"wtiles/2/4/10.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:1024px;top:2560px\"><img src=\"wtiles/2/5/9.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:1280px;top:2304px\"><img src=\"wtiles/2/5/10.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:1280px;top:2560px\"><i style=\"left:1084.9px;top:2578.1px\"></i><i style=\"left:1010.5px;top:2579.6px\"></i><i style=\"left:965.4px;top:2607.6px\"></i><i style=\"left:1008.4px;top:2601.4px\"></i><i style=\"left:1091.8px;top:2587.1px\"></i><i style=\"left:1080.9px;top:2540.4px\"></i><i style=\"left:1019.9px;top:2570.7px\"></i><i style=\"left:1031.3px;top:2581.5px\"></i><i style=\"left:1101.5px;top:2534.5px\"></i><i style=\"left:1024.4px;top:2568.4px\"></i><i style=\"left:1064.2px;top:2606.0px\"></i><i style=\"left:1126.2px;top:2550.7px\"></i><i style=\"left:1099.9px;top:2552.6px\"></i><i style=\"left:1128.1px;top:2528.0px\"></i><i style=\"left:1050.6px;top:2597.4px\"></i><i style=\"left:1050.4px;top:2583.0px\"></i><i style=\"left:1109.7px;top:2519.1px\"></i><i style=\"left:1001.1px;top:2589.7px\"></i><i style=\"left:1138.5px;top:2526.6px\"></i><i style=\"left:1207.2px;top:2561.1px\"></i><i style=\"left:1188.1px;top:2569.2px\"></i></div></figure><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>in the wilds around 2256, 1481 <span class=\"muted\">· 20 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Old%20Maw's%20Sands\">Old Maw&#39;s Sands</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 10 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Sunken%20Avenue\">Sunken Avenue</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 6 spots</span></li><li>in the wilds around 2276, 1423 <span class=\"muted\">· 2 spots</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"mossback-ancient\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Mossback: <a href=\"#/monster/mossback\">Mossback</a> <span class=\"muted\">(48)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by lev